 crash←SaveCrash(filename crash parms);tno;qdmx
⍝ Saves `crash` as the first component of a component file, unless `saveCrash` is 0.\\
⍝ Variables in `crash.Vars` that cannot be written to a component file, instances of classes for example,
⍝ would make that fail for all of `crash`. Should it fail, they are removed and listed in `crash.VarsNotSaved`.\\
⍝ Returns `crash`.
 :If parms.saveCrash
     :Trap (parms.trapInternalErrors)/0
         tno←filename ⎕FCREATE 0
         :Trap 11
             crash ⎕FAPPEND tno
         :Else
             crash←tno RemoveUnsavableVars crash
             crash ⎕FAPPEND tno                  ⍝ Might fail with a WS FULL
         :EndTrap
     :Else
         qdmx←⎕DMX
         :Trap 0
             qdmx.DM ⎕FAPPEND tno
         :EndTrap
     :EndTrap
     :Trap 0
         ⎕FUNTIE tno
     :EndTrap
 :EndIf
